<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Inference on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/inference/</link><description>Recent content in Inference on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/inference/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>NVIDIA Groq 3 LPX</title><link>https://bestofai.io/hardware/nvidia-groq-3-lpx/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/hardware/nvidia-groq-3-lpx/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Groq 3 LPX is the first chip to ship from Nvidia&amp;rsquo;s $20 billion acquisition of Groq, announced in production at Hot Chips 2026. Each LP30 die carries around 500MB of on-chip SRAM with 150 TB/s of bandwidth and handles only token generation, not training or prefill. Nvidia pairs the chips into liquid-cooled racks of 256 LPUs as a companion to its Vera Rubin platform, aimed at the low-latency demands of agentic AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Rebellions Rebel100</title><link>https://bestofai.io/hardware/rebellions-rebel100/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/hardware/rebellions-rebel100/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SambaNova</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/sambanova/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/sambanova/</guid><description/></item><item><title>AI21 Labs</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/ai21-labs/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/ai21-labs/</guid><description/></item><item><title>CoreWeave</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/coreweave-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/coreweave-ai